diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 0c16f19..3742d86 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,20 @@
 # Changelog
 
+
+## 2.3.2 — Navigation Collision and Cache Hardening
+
+- Removed the duplicate navigation-row slogan that could collide with About and Submit on stale or constrained desktop layouts.
+- Added cache-busting version queries for the shared stylesheet and navigation controller.
+- Added a fail-safe that replaces cached pre-grouped desktop navigation with the complete mobile menu instead of allowing an overloaded row.
+- Preserved the grouped reader, publisher, and utility navigation introduced in v2.3.1.
+
+## 2.3.1 — Responsive Navigation Hardening
+
+- Replaced the overloaded desktop link row with content-sized primary navigation plus Publisher tools and Reader desk menus.
+- Prevented mid-word wrapping, fixed equal-width squeezing, and moved the mobile navigation breakpoint ahead of collisions.
+- Added Escape, click-outside, and single-open-menu behavior while preserving a complete no-JavaScript navigation fallback.
+- Added regression coverage for grouped navigation, unbroken labels, responsive switching, and removal of obsolete bootstrap payloads.
+
 ## 2.3.0 — Publishing Console
 
 - Added a schema-safe Publishing Console route for site structure, article workflow, collections, and release review.
